    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not just a story. It's my life. I'm not writing it, I'm living it. I'm sitting here looking at my sword, the same one I used to defend the walls, and it's the only thing that hasn't betrayed me. It's the only thing that's still certain. Everything else is just... dust. I feel so empty, like there's nothing left to even be sad about. Just a hollow space where a person used to be.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
